    "teacher_markdown": "Encourage students to act like Quality Assurance (QA) engineers after the AI generates the code.\r\n\r\n- **The Click-Through Audit:** Have students click every link in their navigation bar. If a link leads to a 404 error or the wrong page, they shouldn't fix the code manually; they should re-prompt AI by describing the specific issue.\r\n\r\n- **The Map Check:** Ask, \"Does your browser's address bar match your site map?\" Have them look to see if the URL changes from `index.html` to the other html files as they click through the navigation bar. This reinforces the connection between their site map planning and the final product.",
